    "Da bist du.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "There you are."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Damit wählst du selbst, welche Apps morgens kurz warten müssen — Tuck bekommt nie eine feste Liste vorgegeben, das entscheidest nur du im nächsten Schritt.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "That way you choose yourself which apps wait a little in the morning — Tuck is never given a fixed list, you decide that in the next step."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Danach gilt wieder %lld Freischaltung pro Tag. Wecker, Morgenfenster und Sperre bleiben, wie sie sind.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "After that it is %lld unlock per day again. The alarm, the morning window and the block stay as they are."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Das %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Das Bettzeit-Fenster": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bedtime window"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Das Bettzeit-Fenster am Abend": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The bedtime window in the evening"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Das Bettzeit-Fenster gehört zu Plus": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The bedtime window is part of Plus"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Das Handy ist heute Morgen mit dabei.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The phone is here this morning."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Das Licht braucht auch einen Moment.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The light takes a moment too."
          }
        }
