    "Dein Stand": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Where you stand"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dein Weg": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your path"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Deine Testphase läuft": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your trial is running"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Deine Zeiten": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your times"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Der App Store hat den Kauf nicht bestätigt. Der Zugang bleibt deshalb, wie er war.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The App Store did not confirm the purchase. Your access therefore stays as it was."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Der Kauf braucht noch die Zustimmung deiner Familienorganisation. Bis dahin ändert sich nichts.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The purchase still needs approval from your family organizer. Nothing changes until then."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Der Morgen hat Form.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The morning has shape."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Der Morgen läuft von selbst.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The morning runs itself."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Der Rest kommt von allein.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The rest comes on its own."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Der Tag fängt langsam an. Du auch.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The day starts slowly. You too."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Der Wecker": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Alarm"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Der Zugriff": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Access"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Der Zugriff fehlt noch. Du kannst ihn in den Systemeinstellungen geben — bis dahin bleiben die Apps offen.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Access is still missing. You can grant it in the Settings app — until then the apps stay open."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Der klassische Griff um 6:30 — einmal aufmachen, zwanzig Minuten weg.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The classic reach at 6:30 — open it once, twenty minutes gone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Die Auswahl erscheint hier, sobald der Zugriff erlaubt ist.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The picker appears here once access is allowed."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Optional — ohne sie bleibt der Abend offen.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Optional — without it the evening stays open."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Die Erlaubnis für den Wecker fehlt noch. Du kannst sie in den Systemeinstellungen geben — ohne sie weckt Tuck dich nicht.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The alarm permission is still missing. You can grant it in the Settings app — without it Tuck does not wake you."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Zählt ab der Weckzeit, gilt ab morgen früh.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Counts from your wake time, applies from tomorrow."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Die Sperre selbst ist mit und ohne Abo gleich streng. Plus nimmt das Tageslimit weg, nie die Verzögerung und nie die Begründung.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The block itself is equally strict with and without a subscription. Plus takes away the daily limit, never the delay and never the reason."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Die Testphase geht zu Ende": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The trial is coming to an end"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Die Testphase hat alles, was Plus hat. Danach gilt %lld Freischaltung pro Tag.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The trial has everything Plus has. After that, %lld unlock per day applies."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Die Testphase ist vorbei": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The trial is over"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Die ersten Minuten gehören dir.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The first minutes are yours."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Diese Weckzeit lässt sich im Kalender nicht auflösen.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This wake time cannot be resolved in the calendar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Gilt morgens und abends.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Applies morning and evening."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dieselbe Sperre, dieselbe Wartezeit, dieselbe Begründung": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The same block, the same wait, the same reason"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Draußen wird es gerade hell.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Outside it is getting light."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dreivierteljahr": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Three quarter year"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dreißigster Morgen.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Thirtieth morning."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Du bist schon da.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You are already here."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Du bist wieder da.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You are back again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Du hast %lld Freischaltung pro Tag.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You have %lld unlock per day."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Du hast Plus.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
