      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I'll leave it after all"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tuck kann seinen gemeinsamen Speicher gerade nicht öffnen. Solange das so ist, wird kein Sperrfenster eingetragen.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tuck cannot open its shared storage right now. Until it can, no block window is entered."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wecker ausschalten": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Turn the alarm off"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wecker ausschalten?": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Turn the alarm off?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Abbrechen": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cancel"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Der Wecker klingelt dann nicht mehr, und das Sperrfenster danach fällt mit weg.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The alarm stops ringing, and the block window after it goes with it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Technik": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Technical"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tuck finanziert sich über das Abo und nicht über Aufmerksamkeit. Keine Werbung, keine Empfehlungen, nichts, was länger dauert als nötig.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tuck is funded by the subscription, not by attention. No ads, no recommendations, nothing that takes longer than it has to."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Das Morgenfenster ist vorbei. Der Rest vom Tag läuft ohne mich.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The morning window is over. The rest of the day runs without me."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Diagnose Abend": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Evening diagnostics"
          }
        }
